## 🛠️ Technologies Used

- **HDL:** Verilog
- **Design Methodology:** RTL Design
- **Control Logic:** Finite State Machines (FSM)
- **Digital Design Concepts:** Interrupt Arbitration, Priority Logic, Handshake Protocols
- **Verification:** Verilog Testbenches

---

## 🚀 Future Enhancements

- Interrupt masking and individual interrupt enable/disable controls.
- Handling simultaneous interrupt requests.
- Nested interrupt support.
- Enhanced priority arbitration mechanisms.
- SystemVerilog-based verification and assertions.
- FPGA synthesis and hardware implementation.

